ith the contract for  America he wanted to privatize the  Department of Education he wanted to  privatize other governmental departments  sound familiar because it's pretty much  what Republicans still want today the  Republican Party has not changed all  Donald Trump has done is come out and  help expose what they actually stand for  what they actually want to do so I don't  believe for a minute the people like  Michael Steele or Joe Scarborough are  truly upset that Donald Trump is  destroying the party because at the end  of the day the policies that Trump has  proposed are no different from policies  we have seen from Republicans for the  last 20 or 30 years
 

